---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Xecutor | Decorator Production Workflow Software | Swishtag";
const description = "Coordinate promotional product decorator production, workstations, inventory, shipping and order status.";
const canonical = "https://cms.swishtag.com/platforms/xecutor/";
const robots = "index,follow";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} robots={robots}>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/generic-page.css" />
  <main><section class="gp-hero"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-kicker">Xecutor</div><h1>Give decorator operations one production view.</h1><p>Xecutor is designed for decoration facilities that need clearer movement from incoming work to production, quality checks and fulfillment.</p><div class="gp-actions"><a class="gp-btn primary" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a><a class="gp-btn secondary" href="/solutions/">Explore solutions</a></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-section-head"><h2>Production software has to match the floor.</h2><p>A useful decorator system should reduce status chasing and duplicate entry without slowing down the people doing the work.</p></div><div class="gp-grid"><article aria-label="Open Production stages" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/book-demo/?service=xecutor" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>WORKFLOWS</small><h3>Production stages</h3><p>Organize work by the actual steps your facility uses instead of generic task lists.</p><a href="/book-demo/?service=xecutor">Map your production flow →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Workstation visibility" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/book-demo/?service=xecutor" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>OPERATIONS</small><h3>Workstation visibility</h3><p>Give teams a clearer view of what is ready, blocked, in progress or completed.</p><a href="/book-demo/?service=xecutor">Discuss operations →</a></article><article aria-label="Open Finish the handoff" class="gp-card st-clickable-card" data-card-href="/book-demo/?service=xecutor" role="link" tabindex="0"><small>FULFILLMENT</small><h3>Finish the handoff</h3><p>Keep inventory, packing and shipping steps connected to the production job.</p><a href="/book-demo/?service=xecutor">See the system →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="gp-section alt"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-split"><div><h2>What this page will cover</h2></div><div class="gp-list"><div>Receive and organize jobs.</div><div>Route work through decoration stages.</div><div>Track exceptions and production status.</div><div>Move completed work into packing and fulfillment.</div></div></div></div></section><section class="gp-section"><div class="gp-wrap"><div class="gp-cta"><div><h2>Have a workflow that does not fit off-the-shelf software?</h2><p>Show us the current process. We can help identify the simplest Shopify, integration, or automation approach before you commit to a larger build.</p></div><a class="gp-btn" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo ↗</a></div><p class="gp-note">This page is connected and launch-ready. Detailed sales copy, proof, screenshots and SEO depth can be expanded in the next content pass.</p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
